.SH NAME
ivcap-ncbi-genome-reports - Show the NCBI genome assembly reports for assembly or BioProject accessions


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBivcap ncbi genome reports ACCESSION... [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Look up the NCBI genome assembly report of each assembly named by the accessions.

.PP
Accessions may be assembly accessions (GCF\fI\&... or GCA\fP\&...) or BioProject accessions (PRJNA...);
a BioProject expands to its assemblies. Use this to find the assembly you want to download.

.PP
With --output json|yaml the full reports are printed. Each report follows the JSON Schema at
https://github.com/ivcap-works/ivcap-ncbi-genome-download/tree/v0.2.0/schema


.SH OPTIONS
\fB--annotated\fP[=false]
	Limit to annotated genomes

.PP
\fB--assembly-level\fP=[]
	Limit to assembly levels (comma-separated): chromosome, complete, contig, scaffold

.PP
\fB--assembly-source\fP="all"
	Limit to 'refseq' (GCF\fI) or 'genbank' (GCA\fP) assemblies

.PP
\fB--assembly-version\fP=""
	Version policy: 'current', 'latest' or 'all' [use the versions given]

.PP
\fB--exclude-atypical\fP[=false]
	Exclude atypical assemblies

.PP
\fB--exclude-multi-isolate\fP[=false]
	Exclude assemblies from multi-isolate projects

.PP
\fB--from-type\fP[=false]
	Only return records with type material

.PP
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for reports

.PP
\fB--mag\fP="all"
	Limit to metagenome assembled genomes ('only') or remove them ('exclude')

.PP
\fB--reference\fP[=false]
	Limit to reference genomes


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
\fB--access-token\fP=""
	Access token to use for authentication with API server [IVCAP_ACCESS_TOKEN]

.PP
\fB--context\fP=""
	Context (deployment) to use

.PP
\fB--debug\fP[=false]
	Set logging level to DEBUG

.PP
\fB--ncbi-api-key\fP=""
	NCBI API key, which raises NCBI's rate limit [NCBI_API_KEY]

.PP
\fB--no-history\fP[=false]
	Do not store history

.PP
\fB-o\fP, \fB--output\fP=""
	Set format for displaying output [json, yaml]

.PP
\fB--silent\fP[=false]
	Do not show any progress information

.PP
\fB--timeout\fP=30
	Max. number of seconds to wait for completion


.SH EXAMPLE
.EX
  ivcap ncbi genome reports GCF_000001735.4
  ivcap --output json ncbi genome reports GCF_000001735.4
  ivcap ncbi genome reports PRJNA10719 --reference
.EE


.SH SEE ALSO
\fBivcap-ncbi-genome(1)\fP


